    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>Allows sideloading with revoked certificates and filters ads/trackers.

LEGEND:

• AB = Adblocking
• UB = Block iOS updates
• KEEP = Prevent blacklists
• INSTALL = Use for installing IPAs

USAGE:

1. Ensure your certificate is not blacklisted.

2. Go to Settings &gt; VPN &amp; Device Management &gt; DNS.

3. Choose INSTALL (sideloading) to block Apple services.

4. Toggle Airplane Mode ON and OFF to clear your DNS cache.

5. Install your apps via WSF portal signer. Trust the certificates in Settings &gt; VPN &amp; Device Management &gt; [Your Cert Name] &gt; Trust.

6. Launch your apps manually OR tap Verify apps under your cert settings.

7. Return to Settings &gt; VPN &amp; Device Management &gt; DNS.

8. Choose KEEP (AB = adblock, UB = block iOS updates).

9. Toggle Airplane Mode ON and OFF to clear your DNS cache.

Guides: wsfteam.xyz
Support: sel@kamikami.eu
Privacy Policy: https://kamikami.eu/blog/privacy-policy</string>
    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
